        <mxCell id="absent" value="&lt;b&gt;Not in the account, by design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;no demo-ui ECR repository (push stays five)&lt;br&gt;no Terraform resource&lt;br&gt;Helm values-eks.yaml: enabled=false&lt;br&gt;nothing listening publicly for the UI&lt;br&gt;a static test in tests/aws/ checks all four&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B7583;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=0;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
