        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;What ENV=aws can demonstrate from the laptop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;the conversation as Asish against the real Runtime, the audit feed, and the bind link as a QR code&lt;br&gt;not the macros: Moment 1–3 and Transplant need the mock's clock and events (local-only)&lt;br&gt;the video's Alexa+ simulator path does not depend on the UI at all&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B7583;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=0;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
